  "period_note": "Year-end position sourced from a later annual report's own multi-year 'Key Financial Information' summary table (audited), Solo basis. Cross-validated against pubalibank-annual-report-2012.txt's own 'Key Financials' table and pubalibank-annual-report-2013.txt's comparative column, both of which agree exactly on Total Deposits (150,418.81), Total Advances (122,068.52) and Paid-up Capital (8,384.51); Total Assets is 192,947.93 per the FY2013/FY2014 reports vs 192,947.92 in the FY2012 report's own table (1,000-taka rounding difference, immaterial — the two-report-agreeing figure is used). profit_before_tax and gross_profit apply this dataset's resolution of a systematic mislabeling found in the FY2012/FY2013 reports' own abbreviated tables: those tables label pre-PROVISION operating profit as 'Pre-tax Profit' (showing 6,135.80 for FY2012), which is arithmetically impossible as a true profit-before-tax figure (PAT of 1,761.98 would imply a 71.3% effective tax rate against 6,135.80, versus a much more plausible 59.2% against the FY2014 table's 'Profit before tax' of 4,317.08). The FY2014 report's fuller table separates the two correctly; 4,317.08 is used as profit_before_tax here and 6,135.79 (effectively identical to the 2012/2013 reports' 6,135.80) is recorded as gross_profit (operating profit, pre-provision). total_liabilities is calculated as total_assets minus total_equity (not separately given in the summary table for this year). All other cross-checks (paid-up+reserve=equity, classified/loans=NPL%, loans/deposits=LDR%, actual-capital/RWA=CAR%, Tier1+Tier2=actual-capital, required-capital=10% of RWA) reconcile exactly for this year.",
